Template: internet-monitor/node-number
Type: string
Description: AllStarLink node number:
 Enter the AllStarLink node number for this Internet Monitor install.
 .
 This value is required. The monitor uses it for local audio announcements
 when connectivity changes. It must be a positive integer (1-999999999).

Template: internet-monitor/node-number/error
Type: error
Description: Invalid node number
 The node number must be a positive integer from 1 to 999999999.
 Please try again.
